      "title": "Interim analysis timing inconsistency: Amendment 2 says administrative assessment after first 53 patients have had opportunity for at least 4 tumor assessments, but Section 6.2 (Planned Interim Analysis) is referenced; no page for that section is provided, but the inconsistency is in the amendment history.",
